@startuml
title Single Step Publication Specialization - Atomic Acceptance & Custody
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Error Handling Unit" as EHU
participant "OperationEntryPublisher" as Pub
participant "Recovery Owner" as RO
participant "Step-Specific Error Handling Composition" as Comp

EHU -> Pub : reserve(attemptIdentity)
Pub --> EHU : ReservationGrant (capacity committed)
EHU -> EHU : prepare ErrorHandlingOperationEntry
(non-throwing handoff representation)
EHU -> Pub : publish(reservation, entry)
alt acceptance succeeds
  Pub -> Pub : atomic acceptance linearization point
  Pub --> EHU : PublicationAccepted
  Pub -> Comp : retain accepted entry
else ambiguous outcome (lost acknowledgement)
  EHU -> Pub : get_publication_status(reservation)
  Pub --> EHU : Consumed | Reserved | Released
  alt Consumed
    Pub --> EHU : publication accepted - do not resubmit
  else Reserved
    EHU -> Pub : retry publish same logical entry
  else Released & pending result
    EHU -> RO : transfer custody (verifiable protocol)
    RO --> EHU : custody confirmed
end

note right of Pub : No-fail ownership transfer boundary
Recovery Owner handles ambiguous acceptance
Entry identity preserved for idempotent retry

@enduml